flowchart TD
    Input["Input Uint8Array"] --> Setup["Initialize ZStream Fields"]
    Setup --> DeflateCall["deflate(Z_FULL_FLUSH)"]
    DeflateCall --> CheckRemaining{"More Input?"}
    CheckRemaining -->|"Yes"| ChunkLoop["Allocate New Chunk and Continue"]
